    "text": "Where the...?"
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "text": "I must be having a nightmare."
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "text": "Or am I?"
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "text": "Who's this little cutie?  "
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "text": "Is she real?  Is she dangerous?"
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "text": "How'd you do that?"
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "text": "Read your thoughts? "
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "text": "Well you gave them to me!"
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "text": "That doesn't make any sense."
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "text": "I was hoping you'd wander around "
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "text": "some more. Explore!"
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "text": "Me?"
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "text": " Yes, you!"
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "text": " You didn't want to go back..."
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "text": "So you reached out to my "
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "text": "consciousness instead!"
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "text": "Now we are one. "
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "text": "Let's play!"
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "text": "Away with ye! "
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "text": "I said be gone."
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "text": "You should stay here forever."
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "text": "No way."
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "text": "We'll live together. "
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "text": "I'll never leave."
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "text": "I'm going back."
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "text": "If you want to go to the other side, "
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "text": "then I have no choice. "
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "text": "I've got to kill you."
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "text": "Why don't you come with me?"
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "text": "You'll like it there."
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "text": "I know you're trying to trick me!"
  }
